{"id":33727,"date":"2024-12-26T15:31:18","date_gmt":"2024-12-26T15:31:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/edusmart.physcode.com\/demo-main\/?p=33727"},"modified":"2026-08-30T12:37:37","modified_gmt":"2026-08-30T12:37:37","slug":"sinav-kaygisiyla-bas-etme-yollari-yks-ogrencileri-icin","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/sinav-kaygisiyla-bas-etme-yollari-yks-ogrencileri-icin\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u0131nav Kayg\u0131s\u0131yla Ba\u015f Etmenin Etkili Yollar\u0131"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"33727\" class=\"elementor elementor-33727\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-109b7d21 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"109b7d21\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25195ab7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"25195ab7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>S\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131, \u00f6zellikle TYT ve YKS gibi \u00f6nemli s\u0131navlara haz\u0131rlanan \u00f6\u011frencilerin s\u0131kl\u0131kla ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 bir durumdur. Kayg\u0131, belli bir seviyeye kadar performans\u0131 art\u0131rabilse de, kontrol edilemedi\u011finde ba\u015far\u0131y\u0131 olumsuz etkileyebilir. \u0130\u015fte s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131yla etkili bir \u015fekilde ba\u015f etmenin yollar\u0131:<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Kayg\u0131y\u0131 Tan\u0131ma ve Kabul Etme<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Kayg\u0131yla ba\u015f etmenin ilk ad\u0131m\u0131, onu tan\u0131mak ve varl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kabul etmektir.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Fiziksel belirtileri fark edin:<\/strong> Kalp \u00e7arp\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131, terleme, titreme, mide bulant\u0131s\u0131 gibi belirtiler kayg\u0131n\u0131n g\u00f6stergeleridir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Duygusal tepkilerinizi g\u00f6zlemleyin:<\/strong> Endi\u015fe, korku, panik veya felaket senaryolar\u0131 kurma e\u011filiminde olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 fark edin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Kayg\u0131y\u0131 normalle\u015ftirin:<\/strong> S\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n normal ve yayg\u0131n bir durum oldu\u011funu kabul edin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Etkili \u00c7al\u0131\u015fma Stratejileri Geli\u015ftirme<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>\u0130yi haz\u0131rlanmak, s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 azaltman\u0131n en temel yollar\u0131ndan biridir.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Uzun vadeli planlama yap\u0131n:<\/strong> S\u0131nava yeterli s\u00fcre kala d\u00fczenli \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmaya ba\u015flayarak son dakika stresinden ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Aktif \u00f6\u011frenme tekniklerini kullan\u0131n:<\/strong> Pasif okuma yerine, notlar alma, \u00f6zet \u00e7\u0131karma, soru \u00e7\u00f6zme gibi aktif \u00f6\u011frenme y\u00f6ntemlerine y\u00f6nelin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i s\u0131nav sim\u00fclasyonlar\u0131 yap\u0131n:<\/strong> S\u0131nav ortam\u0131na al\u0131\u015fmak i\u00e7in ger\u00e7ek s\u0131nav ko\u015fullar\u0131n\u0131 taklit eden denemeler \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Zihinsel Kontrol Tekniklerini Uygulama<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcncelerimiz duygular\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 ve davran\u0131\u015flar\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 etkiler. Olumsuz d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnce kal\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftirmek kayg\u0131yla ba\u015f etmede \u00f6nemlidir.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Olumsuz d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnceleri tespit edin:<\/strong> &#8220;Kesinlikle ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olaca\u011f\u0131m&#8221; veya &#8220;Hi\u00e7bir \u015fey hat\u0131rlamayaca\u011f\u0131m&#8221; gibi d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnceleri fark edin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i alternatiflerle de\u011fi\u015ftirin:<\/strong> &#8220;Elimden gelenin en iyisini yapaca\u011f\u0131m&#8221; veya &#8220;Haz\u0131rland\u0131\u011f\u0131m konularda ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131 olabilirim&#8221; gibi daha ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnceler geli\u015ftirin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Pozitif kendi kendine konu\u015fma tekni\u011fini kullan\u0131n:<\/strong> &#8220;Bu s\u0131nav\u0131 ba\u015farabilirim&#8221;, &#8220;Yeterince haz\u0131rland\u0131m&#8221; gibi olumlu c\u00fcmlelerle kendinizi motive edin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Gev\u015feme ve Odaklanma Tekniklerini \u00d6\u011frenme<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Fiziksel ve zihinsel gev\u015feme teknikleri, s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131yla ba\u015fa \u00e7\u0131kmada etkilidir.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Derin nefes egzersizleri yap\u0131n:<\/strong> 4 saniye nefes al\u0131p, 4 saniye tutup, 6 saniye vererek derin nefes al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 yap\u0131n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Progresif kas gev\u015fetme tekni\u011fini uygulay\u0131n:<\/strong> V\u00fccudunuzdaki kas gruplar\u0131n\u0131 s\u0131rayla gerip gev\u015feterek fiziksel gerginli\u011fi azalt\u0131n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Mindfulness meditasyonu yap\u0131n:<\/strong> G\u00fcnde 10-15 dakika meditasyon yaparak odaklanma becerinizi geli\u015ftirin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 Ya\u015fam Al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131 Edinme<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Fiziksel sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z, zihinsel durumunuzu do\u011frudan etkiler.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>D\u00fczenli uyuyun:<\/strong> \u00d6zellikle s\u0131nav \u00f6ncesi gecede 7-8 saatlik uyku almaya \u00f6zen g\u00f6sterin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Dengeli beslenin:<\/strong> Kafein ve \u015feker gibi uyar\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131r\u0131p, beyin fonksiyonlar\u0131n\u0131 destekleyen besinleri tercih edin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Fiziksel aktivite yap\u0131n:<\/strong> D\u00fczenli egzersiz, stres hormonlar\u0131n\u0131n dengelenmesine yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. S\u0131nav G\u00fcn\u00fc Stratejileri<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>S\u0131nav g\u00fcn\u00fcnde uygulayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z stratejiler, kayg\u0131 seviyenizi kontrol etmenize yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilir.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Erken haz\u0131rlan\u0131n:<\/strong> Ge\u00e7 kalmak kayg\u0131y\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131r. S\u0131nava gitmek i\u00e7in yeterli zaman\u0131 ay\u0131r\u0131n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>S\u0131nav ba\u015flang\u0131c\u0131nda k\u0131sa bir gev\u015feme egzersizi yap\u0131n:<\/strong> S\u0131nava ba\u015flamadan \u00f6nce birka\u00e7 derin nefes al\u0131n ve kaslar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 gev\u015fetin.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Kademeli ilerleme stratejisini uygulay\u0131n:<\/strong> \u00d6nce bildi\u011finiz sorular\u0131 \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn, daha sonra zorlanaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z sorulara ge\u00e7in.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:heading --><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Profesyonel Destek Alma<\/h2>\n<p><!-- \/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>\u015eiddetli ve kronik s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131 durumunda profesyonel destek almaktan \u00e7ekinmeyin.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Okul rehberlik servisinden yararlan\u0131n:<\/strong> \u00c7o\u011fu okulda, \u00f6\u011frencilere s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131yla ba\u015f etme konusunda yard\u0131mc\u0131 olan rehberlik servisleri bulunur.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Psikolojik dan\u0131\u015fmanl\u0131k hizmetleri al\u0131n:<\/strong> Bili\u015fsel davran\u0131\u015f\u00e7\u0131 terapi gibi y\u00f6ntemler, s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 azaltmada etkilidir. [Bili\u015fsel davran\u0131\u015f\u00e7\u0131 terapi](<a href=\"https:\/\/uskudar.edu.tr\/usbdt\">https:\/\/uskudar.edu.tr\/usbdt<\/a>) gibi y\u00f6ntemler, s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 azaltmada etkilidir.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Grup terapilerine kat\u0131l\u0131n:<\/strong> Benzer sorunlar\u0131 ya\u015fayan akranlar\u0131n\u0131zla bir araya gelerek deneyimlerinizi payla\u015f\u0131n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:list --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\/p>\n<p>Bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te ailelerin de do\u011fru yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 b\u00fcy\u00fck fark yarat\u0131r \u2014 [Ailelerin S\u0131nav S\u00fcrecinde \u00c7ocuklar\u0131na Yakla\u015f\u0131m\u0131 Nas\u0131l Olmal\u0131?](<a href=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/ailelerin-sinav-surecinde-cocuklarina-yaklasimi-nasil-olmali\/\">https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/ailelerin-sinav-surecinde-cocuklarina-yaklasimi-nasil-olmali<\/a>\/) yaz\u0131m\u0131za da g\u00f6z atabilirsiniz<\/p>\n<p>Unutmay\u0131n ki s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131 y\u00f6netilebilir bir durumdur ve do\u011fru stratejilerle kontrol alt\u0131na al\u0131nabilir. Kendinize g\u00fcvenin, iyi haz\u0131rlan\u0131n ve s\u0131nav performans\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 olumsuz etkileyebilecek d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnce ve duygularla ba\u015f etmeyi \u00f6\u011frenin. S\u0131nav\u0131n hayat\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n tek belirleyicisi olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, sadece bir a\u015fama oldu\u011funu hat\u0131rlay\u0131n. Ba\u015far\u0131, sadece s\u0131nav sonucuyla de\u011fil, bu s\u00fcre\u00e7te kazand\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z bilgi, beceri ve deneyimlerle de \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcl\u00fcr.<\/p>\n<p><!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>S\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131, \u00f6zellikle TYT ve YKS gibi \u00f6nemli s\u0131navlara haz\u0131rlanan \u00f6\u011frencilerin s\u0131kl\u0131kla ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 bir durumdur. Kayg\u0131, belli bir seviyeye kadar performans\u0131 art\u0131rabilse de, kontrol edilemedi\u011finde ba\u015far\u0131y\u0131 olumsuz&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":35421,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[16],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-33727","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ogrenci-rehberligi"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>S\u0131nav Kayg\u0131s\u0131yla Ba\u015f Etmenin Etkili Yollar\u0131 - Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat E\u011fitim<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"S\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131 ba\u015far\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 m\u0131 etkiliyor? Gaziosmanpa\u015fa Murat E\u011fitim rehberlik uzmanlar\u0131ndan s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\